flowchart TB
 UI[React components] --> CLIENT[api.ts / fast-api.ts / session.ts]
 CLIENT --> PROXY[proxy/worker.ts]
 PROXY --> HAND[api/handler.ts]
 HAND --> ROUTES[api/library.ts + playlist-api.ts]
 ROUTES --> C[contracts.ts / validation]
 ROUTES --> DB[database.ts / RPC client]
 ENTRY[api/index.ts + jobs/index.ts] --> DRAIN[jobs.ts / drainJobs]
 DRAIN --> LIB[library.ts]
 DRAIN --> PR[playlist-runtime.ts + playlist-runner.ts]
 DRAIN --> BACK[annotation-backups.ts]
 PR --> DOMAIN[playlist-domain.ts / pure behavior]
 LIB --> SP[spotify.ts / guarded adapter]
 PR --> SP
 SP --> TOK[tokens.ts / serialized refresh]
 TOK --> CRYPTO[crypto.ts]
 LIB --> DB
 PR --> DB
 BACK --> DB
 BACK --> STORAGE[backups.ts / Storage adapter]
 DB --> SQL[Versioned SQL migrations / atomic RPCs]